quoted string "\\24" as the semantic value of an identifier
in Dart Sass 3.0.0. For forwards-compatibility, use an unquoted string instead:

Suggestion: meta.load-css(..., $with: (\\24: ...)))

More info: https://sass-lang.com/d/meta-escape

  ,
2 | @include meta.load-css("other", $with: ("\\24": override));
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
    input.scss 2:1  root stylesheet

